Package: grsem
Type: Package
Title: Grouped Regularized Structural Equation Modeling Prototype
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Zhuoer", "Zhang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "zhangze2048@ruc.edu.cn")
Author: Zhuoer Zhang
Maintainer: Zhuoer Zhang <zhangze2048@ruc.edu.cn>
Description: Research prototype for grouped regularized structural equation
    modeling, candidate structural-role diagnostics, and experimental Bayesian
    backends. Relative regularization paths, proximal gradient and accelerated
    solvers, post-selection refitting, sample splitting, and structure-role
    diagnostics are kept distinct. Continuous maximum likelihood is the
    Core backend; ordered DWLS and Stan interfaces are experimental.
